<TD><font color=#006400 size=2><b>VL遠足のお金。。</b></font></TD>
<TD nowrap><font size=2>　投稿者:<font color=#0000FF><b>Ponkotsu</b></font>　</font><small>2003/02/02(Sun) 05:55:40</small></TD>
<TD align=right nowrap><a href="#menu">■</a>&nbsp<a href="#topic_25">▲</a>&nbsp;<a href="#topic_21">▼</a></TD>
</TR></TABLE>
</TD></TR></TABLE>
