<TD><font color=#006400 size=2><b>FG・Raid　Roll！！！</b></font></TD>
<TD nowrap><font size=2>　投稿者:<font color=#0000FF><b>Lyrwin</b></font>　</font><small>2002/12/23(Mon) 05:04:27</small></TD>
<TD align=right nowrap><a href="#menu">■</a>&nbsp<a href="#topic_16">▲</a>&nbsp;<a href="#topic_15">▼</a></TD>
